      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "For this year's Qixi Festival (Chinese Valentine's Day), Saint Laurent presents a new campaign titled \"Love Letters, Love Matters.\" Through cinematic imagery, the campaign translates letters written by martial arts legend Bruce Lee, sociologist Li Yinhe, and contemporary poet Xu Peifen into visual language, exploring the emotional power of love, longing, and connection.",
