    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "The Qixi selection centers on the new mini**Niki**handbag, crafted from aged calfskin leather in a compact silhouette (18x12.5x5 cm). It features signature V-stitch quilting and a YSL Cassandre metal emblem. The bag offers two main compartments, a front pocket, and a back pocket—despite its mini size, it holds everyday essentials like a smartphone, keys, cards, and tissues. The sliding chain strap allows for shoulder or crossbody wear. Available in seven colors: grass green, bright apricot, beige, pure white, vermilion red, black with gold hardware, and black with silver hardware, plus a caramel suede version. With light, dark, bright, and classic shades, there's one to suit every taste.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
